OL,3,GNEWSAHospital pauses all planned
OL,4,Apaediatric surgery after care concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian has suspended all planned
OL,7,Fpaediatric surgery at Dr Gray's
OL,8,FHospital in Elgin after concerns were
OL,9,Fraised about the quality and safety of
OL,10,Fcare for children.
OL,12,FThe health board said emergency
OL,13,Fpaediatric surgery had already been
OL,14,Fpaused in June, with some exceptions,
OL,15,Fafter concerns were identified about
OL,16,Fsurgical services.
OL,18,FIt has now extended the suspension to
OL,19,Finclude all planned procedures,
OL,20,Fincluding elective dental and ear, nose
OL,21,Fand throat (ENT) operations.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
